{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星孫儷長年穩居一線地位，她與老公鄧超結婚16年，二人育有一子一女，一家四口生活美滿，仍難免受到外界的傳聞困擾，面對輿論壓力，她自嘲鴕鳥，盡量不看社交平台，也透露女兒小花曾受網絡傳聞影響，擔心她和鄧超會離婚。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.267591+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"31838e80977170ec0880977f290a9ee657e672395f26be9c2aec123f3c847224","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}